yunohost (12.1.41.119) stable; urgency=low

  * nostr_operations: fix operation status wrongly forced to FAILED. A
    completed execution result (2204, ok=true) reduced without its
    preceding execution-started (2203) event in the fetched relay
    snapshot was incorrectly reported as FAILED instead of SUCCEEDED --
    this happens routinely since 2203 propagation commonly lags 2204,
    so recently completed operations (including service.status/restart)
    could read as failed even though they succeeded.

