yunohost (12.1.41.55) stable; urgency=low

  * Modernize the residual YunoHost Python base (docs/MODERNIZATION.md):
    - HTTP layer: the native API and portal-api now run on FastAPI/uvicorn
      (bottle removed entirely); shared per-request state moved to
      nostrhost.web.
