yunohost (12.1.41.49) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: also reconcile native app web routes after a Caddy *reload*,
    not just a restart.
    - 12.1.41.47's nostrhost-web-reconcile.service only triggers via
      caddy.service's Wants= on unit *start*; `caddy reload --config X`
      (used by 15-caddy's do_post_regen whenever the base Caddyfile
      changes) fully replaces the active config the same way a restart
      does, dropping admin-API-only native routes, but never triggers a
      systemd unit start - so it slipped through untouched (found live:
      an unrelated regenconf run on the clean7 VM reloaded Caddy and
      silently broke every native app again).
    - 15-caddy's do_post_regen now also fires
      `systemctl start --no-block nostrhost-web-reconcile.service` right
      after its `caddy reload`, best-effort, so every reload self-heals
      the same as every restart.

